menu "SempreIoT link"

    config SIOT_BENCH_BOARD_DEAF
        bool "BENCH ONLY: this node never reaches the central"
        default n
        help
            RELAXED FOR THE BENCH (docs/ota/before-production.md item 12).
            The node is told a board access point address that does not
            exist, so every connect to the board ends in "no such access
            point": a unit out of the central's reach, on a table where
            every unit hears every other. Such a unit can never be the
            root. Built by `firmware/build.sh node --deaf` into its own
            directory (apps/node/build-deaf); never set it in
            apps/node/sdkconfig.defaults — ci/check.sh --release fails
            while any node configuration has it.

endmenu
